{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Living Longer Better", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "The Importance of Sleep", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 6, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 11, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.1", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Describe  routines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn6le11ob06re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "The Present Perfect Tense vs. The Simple Past Tense", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the Present Perfect tense to talk about a finished action or event that is connected to the present in some way. <br> <br> You use the Simple Past tense to talk about a finished action or event <span class=\"strong\">not</span> connected to the present.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<p>When you talk about an action or an event that occurred in the past, but you do not specify when it occurred (maybe it's not relevant to say when it happened), you use the Present Perfect.</p>  <p>When you want to say when an action or an event occurred at a specific time in the past, you use the Simple Past. </p>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Here are some time expressions for Present Perfect which refers to indefinite time, and some for Simple Past which refers to definite time.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe you haven't gotten  ill yet, but you could. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Did you lie awake for hours? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Present Perfect \u2013 indefinite </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":1,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I have done it ...</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">for a long time.<br/>lately.<br/>before.<br/>recently.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\"\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Simple Past \u2013 definite </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":1,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I did it ...</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">yesterday.<br/>last night.<br/>two days ago.<br/>at 8 o'clock.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\"\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Offering Health Advice and Solutions", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You can offer advice and solutions to people on how to improve their sleeping habits and why sleep is necessary.<br><br> Here is a list of expressions you can use to offer advice and solutions:<ul><li><span class=\"italic\">You should ...</span></li><li><span class=\"italic\">You need to ...</span></li><li><span class=\"italic\">You ought to ...</span> (strong request) </li><li><span class=\"italic\">You had better ...</span>(strong request)</li></ul>", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Offering Advice and Solutions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><ul> <li> If you haven't had a good night's sleep for a few days running, you had better do something about it.</li><li>Most adults ought to get 8 hours of it every night. </li><li>For insomnia, you should keep a sleep diary to help the doctor evaluate you.  </li><li>You ought to ask about an herbal or over-the-counter sleeping aid.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "theory", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an explanation for a series of facts ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: One theory  says that sleep has a restorative function.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le11ob06aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about sleep problems.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "restorative", "type": "name"}, {"content": "making you feel more energetic ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: After a long day, a hot bath is restorative. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le11ob06aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "function", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the way something works ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: One function of the heart is to send blood to all parts of the body.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le11ob06aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "mental", "type": "name"}, {"content": "involving thinking  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Sleep allows mental development. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le11ob06aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to evaluate", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to assess ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: A sleep diary will help your doctor evaluate the problem. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le11ob06aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "diary", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a book to write personal thoughts in  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She has always kept a diary. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le11ob06aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "over-the-counter", "type": "name"}, {"content": "medication that can be bought without a prescription  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There are many over-the-counter sleep aids. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le11ob06aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "refreshed", "type": "name"}, {"content": "more energetic and relaxed  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I feel refreshed after a good night's sleep. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le11ob06aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "aid ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "something that helps  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The sleeping aid relaxed me and I went to sleep.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le11ob06aud09", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Go online and research \u2018problems sleeping'.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write down some ways to help sleep problems.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Now write a dialogue with 75 to 100 words asking a friend about his or her sleep and giving him or her advice.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your dialogue aloud with a partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I research \u2018problems sleeping'.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write a dialogue about sleep problems and possible solutions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I give advice.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I read the dialogue aloud with a partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn6le11ob06re2img01.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn6le11ob06re2img01.jpg", "time": "", "id": 1, "text": "Have you had problems sleeping? Were you tired at work today? Did you have trouble concentrating? If you haven't had a good night's sleep for a few days running, you had better do something about it.\nWe all need sleep."}, {"image": "engenn6le11ob06re2img01.jpg", "time": "13500", "id": 2, "text": "One theory says sleep has a restorative function. Most adults ought to get 8 hours of it every night. Children ought to get more. It's essential for their physical and mental development. Sleep, like food, is necessary to keep the body and mind functioning well."}, {"image": "engenn6le11ob06re2img02.jpg", "time": "32000", "id": 3, "text": "Have you had insomnia? Did you lie awake for hours? Did you still feel tired in the morning? Maybe you haven't gotten ill yet, but you could. You'd better call the doctor and make an appointment. You should also keep a sleep diary to help him or her evaluate you. You ought to ask about an herbal or over-the-counter sleeping aid. Insomnia is a disorder and can be treated.\nDeep, uninterrupted sleep relieves tiredness and irritability. You wake refreshed and ready for the day."}], "audiosrc": "engenn6le11ob06re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le11ob06re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about staying healthy.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can discuss experiences I've had or haven't had.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can offer advice and solutions.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " How well do you sleep?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What have you done when you've had trouble sleeping?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next 